  m_Name: HollowmereDirector
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  authoringId: aba08c89-cd6d-450d-a9ba-ad9167691d2e
  quest: DrownedBell
  endings:
  - branch: 1
    title: 'Ending A: The Silence'
    body: You let the Drowned Bell sleep. The Echo fades into the stones and Blackmere
      keeps its silence. Thornwick never learns how close the marsh came to waking.
    musicState: music.ending
  - branch: 2
    title: 'Ending B: The Toll'
    body: The bell tolls once across the black water. Thornwick sleeps soundly for
      the first time since the flood, though in the belfry the Echo stays, bound
      to its bell.
    musicState: music.ending
  - branch: 3
    title: 'Ending C: The Freed Echo'
    body: With the shrine alight, the toll carries the Echo out over the water like
      a lantern on the tide. The marsh is only a marsh again, and Maren lights a
      candle for the drowned.
    musicState: music.ending
  - branch: -1
    title: The Marsh Keeps What It Takes
    body: Your last light sinks into Blackmere. In the dark the reeds close behind
      you, and the bell stays silent.
    musicState: music.tense
